WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.900
Good morning!

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.790
Cold, isn't it, Minami?

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.840
Yes. It is quite cold.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.820
Good morning!

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.410
Good morning.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:22.070
But how nice is it that you've got
another shot at the Paradise Coord?

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.630
You'd better get it this time.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:24.750
Capisce!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.670
We're super totally seriously gonna get the Paradise Coord!

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.140
<i>It really is nice, isn't it, Minami?</i>

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.810
No, Mireille.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:38.420
We'll get the Paradise Coord and make it shine.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.680
Falulu couldn't do it.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.640
So if we make it shine...

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.600
<i>It will be a total victory over Falulu!</i>

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:51.060
<i>But no matter how I run the numbers, we can't win as we are now.</i>

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.320
<i>How could we...</i>

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.220
How about you give some chocolates to Meganii?

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.120
You're making some yourself again?

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.230
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.850
Are you giving anyone some?

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:04.540
Why should I? I'm on the receiving end there.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.880
I think Tanaka is hoping you'll give him some.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.220
Tanaka? Who's that?

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.510
Tanaka?

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:16.190
Don't you remember? We got a birthday present from him.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:17.220
We did?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.770
<i>Oh yeah, it's almost Valentine's.</i>

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:24.850
Uh, Minami...

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.470
What is it, Amamiya?

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.820
I really love sweet stuff.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.850
And I was thinking, my name is Amamiya...

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:38.400
I, Amamiya, am amiably disposed toward sweets.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.260
Sweet... Sugar-coated! Have I been...

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.360
<i>Seems I need to be more forceful, so she knows I want chocolates.</i>

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>She has to notice!</i>

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.590
Oh, look, ants!

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:51.940
Ants?

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.110
They're carrying bits of chocolate.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:57.840
Ants do love sweet things after all. It's instinctual!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.660
The ants have nothing to <i>hive!</i>

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.330
The instinct of the ants?

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.850
I love chocolate, just like the ants!

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.310
What a coincidence!

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:12.520
Ant, instinct, nothing to hide...

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.900
Ants, nothing to hide...

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:17.620
Minami?

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:24.950
Nothing to <i>hive!</i> The perfect answer!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.890
Don't forget to value your friends, everyone!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.890
They are irreplaceable treasures!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.240
Isn't that right, Rina?

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.940
<i>I can tell.</i>

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.700
<i>She's about to make a big announcement.</i>

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.780
<i>And it is no doubt...</i>

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.740
<i>That's right. I've been sugar-coating the facts. Or chocolate-coating, perhaps.</i>

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:32.040
<i>Mireille is a character whose features I calculated to maximize popularity.</i>

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:38.400
<i>Compared to that, Lala, Sophie, Dorothy, Leona, Shion...</i>

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.460
<i>Not to mention Falulu, all have nothing to hide.</i>

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.090
<i>They simply are themselves.</i>

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:47.000
<i>How could I possibly beat any of them as a made up character?</i>

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.100
<i>I will shed that sugar-coated shell! As proof of that...</i>

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:55.410
<i>I will announce in front of everyone that I am SoLaMi SMILE's Mireille.</i>

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:58.770
<i>Not as a made up character, but as who I truly am.</i>

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.570
<i>I will fight with Minami Mirei's 100%.<b></b></i>

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.450
<i>That will be the proof of my dedication to my dream, and my courage.</i>

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:11.840
<i>Everyone will surely be touched by my boldness, support me</i>

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:15.960
<i>and gain the courage to chase after their own dreams as well!</i>

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.940
<i>She's going to say it.</i>

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:22.960
<i>I must do my part as MC to build up her announcement!</i>

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.320
Amamiya!

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:24.970
Minami?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:28.340
Good hosting! Now, take these chocolates!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.600
Thank you very much!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.520
<i>All right, let's do this!</i>

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.980
Do like Rina and suck and suck!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:40.020
Suck up all that learning!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.480
Yeees.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.470
That will be all!

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.570
Thank you, Headmistress Ookanda.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:50.240
And lastly, we have an announcement from our head disciplinarian, Minami.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.670
Okay.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:56.650
She has some important pointers on our rules and regulations, and also...

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:01.690
Everyone!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:06.210
She would like to announce she's part of SoLaMi SMILE!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:06.630
Go ahead!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:07.440
What?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:15.040
Which member of SoLaMi SMILE could she be?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.570
Please do tell!

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.780
Uh... Err... Well...

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.770
I'm actually...

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.610
Mireille...

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:25.610
She what?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.820
No way.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.410
Seriously?

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.070
What?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.030
What?!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.200
Warning ticket!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:40.060
Rule 4009! Ruining surprises is strictly disallowed!

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.880
I-I'm sorry...

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.490
I was going to make it way more shocking and out of nowhere!

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:47.160
Everyone was going to be so excited!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:50.040
No one even bought it because of your stupid reveal!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.390
I'm sorry! I just wanted to make myself useful...

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.600
How did you even know?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.310
H-How did I know?

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:05.320
Mireille! Show us your brilliance!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:09.030
Mireille and I look nothing alike.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.280
That doesn't matter. When you first started performing as Mireille...

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:23.030
I recognized you immediately.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:25.740
I could tell! Because I...

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.190
<i>love...</i>

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:32.560
Whatever. I'm very disappointed in you, Amamiya.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.480
Can't even host a simple school event...

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.890
M-Minami!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:46.020
It's over! No way am I getting any chocolates from her!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.220
I've got some chocolates for you too, Lala!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.890
Thanks, I've got some for you too! Let's chocosnap!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.110
Yeah, chocosnap!

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:57.270
Valentine's... Good ring to it.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.290
Do you make chocolates and stuff, Shion?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.410
Excellence in everything!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.520
I'll participate in any old popular thing, but with my sights on unusual heights!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.800
How about you, Leona?

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:15.760
I'm... thinking of making chocolate glasses for Mr. Meganii.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.300
Chocolate glasses?

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.470
Oh my...

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:26.450
My sweet exterior... just got even sweeter.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.990
What now?

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:35.020
Please take responsibility and use your mouth to ascertain how sweet I really am.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.200
That might just happen!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.400
Tochiotome Cool Lovely.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.430
So sad.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.620
What's sad?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.960
Love wants to give chocolates to someone.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.590
What? Who? Who?

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.510
My... coach.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:54.480
Mr. Nishiki Goi.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.030
Like koi fish?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:58.800
Nishiki is his family name, and Goi his first name.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:04.020
But his jumping smashes really are like beautiful koi climbing up waterfalls.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.010
They call him Air G.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:07.970
Goi!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:15.230
Come on, you can do it! I'm rooting for you!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.350
But... But but!

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.760
Love Thirty! Love Fourty!

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.200
She's too embarrassed.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.210
How do I look-kuma?

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:25.860
What's your problem-kuma?

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.290
I'll be taking all the chocolates-usa!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:34.510
Oh, Mireille! Are you giving someone chocolates for Valentine's?

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.970
No, I'm not.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.680
Whaaat?!

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:40.140
What's with the outfit?

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:43.350
I have thrown away all that chocolatey sweet stuff.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.060
Mireille! You're forgetting the "pri" from the end of your sentences!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.600
You can't forget your own character-kuma!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:50.780
Look at me for ex—

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.780
I don't need the pri anymore.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:10:01.240
To defeat Falulu I must discard my fake persona and fight as 100% me, Minami Mirei.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.500
Plain old me. My true face,

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.670
that is the key to bringing out the full power of all my body and soul!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.440
Mi... Mireille?

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.880
All one's body and soul. An admirable sentiment.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.840
For the dream of becoming the top idol!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:19.590
I'm quitting pri!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.550
Whaaat?!

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.900
Good morning.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.360
Good morning-def.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.570
Morning... Def?

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:40.860
Uh, huh? What did I just say-off?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.000
<i>Strange...</i>

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.980
I heard the head disciplinarian... I mean SoLaMi SMILE's Mireille

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.220
is stopping saying "pri" to reveal her true power or something.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:51.420
What? No way!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.130
I'm sorry!

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.120
Apologizing won't get you out of this.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:58.380
Paprika Academy's rule number...

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.840
Number...

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.300
Minami?

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.510
<i>Number... What was it?</i>

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:09.480
<i>How could I forget a rule?</i>

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.110
W-Well, no matter.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.160
I'll let it slide, just this one time.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.690
Ca... Capisce.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.660
<i>This is definitely weird.</i>

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:24.460
Stopping the pri... I could never stop the chanko-chanko!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:32.580
Huh? No reaction... Why?

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.780
What's wrong with my My Ticket?

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:39.000
Minami, that's not your My Ticket, that's a bunch of maitake mushrooms.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:43.830
<i>Something's wrong with... me.</i>

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.470
Mireille's being weird?

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.210
Yeah. For a while now.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.660
Definitely weird.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.540
Sophie, that's not straw, that's squid.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:05.180
<i>What is happening to me?</i>

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:08.790
<i>I feel out of shape. Out of rhythm.</i>

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:11.500
<i>Something weird is going on...</i>

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.990
<i>Keep it together, Minami Mirei.</i>

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:18.460
<i>You even managed to throw away pri to defeat Falulu.</i>

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:23.060
<i>Fight as yourself, and no one else.</i>

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.430
Minami...

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:34.600
You have it good. Nothing to worry about. Nothing to... <i>hive.</i>

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.560
Th-That's it!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.780
Good morning!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.280
Morning-chanko.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.200
Take a look at this, everyone!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.160
I made this chocolate heart for Rina!

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:52.080
Suck, suck, suck it all up!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:59.340
<i>This is my time. This time I will support her message perfectly!</i>

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.450
Happy Valentine's!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:05.220
Thank you very much, Headmistress Ookanda.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:10.360
And lastly, we have some pointers about our regulations from our head disciplinarian, Minami.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.020
But before that...

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:15.230
Huh? Amamiya?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.780
I'll confess as the plainest me I can be!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:34.010
Head Disciplinarian Minami! And Mireille!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:37.210
Please accept this!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:44.630
Happy Valentine's. I poured my heart into making these chocolates.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.720
I threw away all the sweetness! What good would chocolates...

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.870
Please eat them!

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:01.770
Pri Pride

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.740
P-Pri pride?

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:12.910
That's right. There is no need for you to, for Mireille to get rid of the pri.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:18.900
But I left the sweetness behind to bring out 100% of my strength.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:22.130
Mireille is already part of you, Minami!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:28.140
Having watched you two from the start, I can tell.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:31.250
Perhaps she was nothing but a made up character in the start.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:34.430
But she is already a real part of who you are.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:39.400
Ignoring that and trying to quit your pri has just made you lose your composure.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.650
That's why you've not been yourself lately!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.320
T-That can't... But...

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:49.530
The first rule of Paprika Academy!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:53.200
A student should always believe in themselves!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.950
Your sweetness, just like your strictness, is a part of <i>you</i>!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.870
Warning Ticket!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.870
Head Disciplinarian... Mireille!

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:22.100
P-Pri pride.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.310
Pri pride, indeed!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:32.120
Pri pride!

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.660
I finally understand...

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.880
Your equation...

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.040
Was 100% correct!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.350
M-Minami!

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:46.880
I, Minami Mirei, am SoLaMi SMILE's Mireille!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.630
I plan to work my hardest to attain my dream with great pri pride.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.850
And I'm counting on your support-pri!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.310
Pri! Pri! Pri! Pri! Pri...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.700
Amamiya, today's Valentine's Live...

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:17.310
is dedicated to you.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.370
But!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:21.910
Just as friends.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.010
Way too saccharine. But I suppose...

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.120
I'm no better.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.140
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.770
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.800
Coord Change Start!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.310
The melted chocolate skirt really catches the eye.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:53.650
And the gold will make you feel rich.
The melted chocolate skirt really catches the eye.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.200
And the gold will make you feel rich.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.240
Raspberry Gothic Choco Dress!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:07.920
And Mireille's combines the sweetest custard and ever so slightly tart strawberries.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.450
Valentine Strawberry Choco Dress! Pri!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.260
Switching to blueberries makes for a much cooler look.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.640
Are you ready to savor SoLaMi SMILE's delicious Valentine's show?

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.320
Valentine Blueberry Choco Dress!

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:31.410
<i>PriChoco! Valentine's Live!</i>

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:35.450
<i>Time to show off my pri pride!</i>

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.650
<i>You look fabulous, Mireille!</i>

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:42.950
<i>This is me. 100% Minami Mirei!</i>

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.860
Take this chocolate ball, coach! Lovely Smash!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.330
Good smash, Love!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.800
Bring it on! Bring it on!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.190
Yes sir, Coach Ishiki!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.530
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.080
February!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:06.660
14th!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.280
Saint Valentine's Day!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.610
To your loved ones!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.750
To those close to you!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.590
To those always with you!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.700
This one's right from the heart!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:25.080
Exciting Present For You!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:27.850
Cyalume Change!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.330
Pri! Pri! Pri!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:51.080
I am Amamiya... I am amiable to sweetness!

